WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:03:08.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
03:08.560 --> 03:11.640
Daddy, please don't shoot Mommy.

3
03:11.720 --> 03:12.880
‎PREVIOUSLY

4
03:12.960 --> 03:16.400
Please ask me to do something else. I can't kill someone.

5
03:16.480 --> 03:17.440
If you don't help me,

6
03:17.520 --> 03:18.520
I'll expose you.

7
03:18.600 --> 03:21.400
If I don't kill him, he'll drag me straight to prison.

8
03:21.480 --> 03:24.600
Grandpa left everything to Hathaya.

9
03:24.680 --> 03:26.960
Dead people can't talk.

10
04:12.160 --> 04:13.280
Grandpa.

11
04:24.920 --> 04:26.520
Aren't you happy

12
04:27.200 --> 04:29.160
to see your favorite granddaughter?

13
04:35.120 --> 04:36.120
Of course.

14
04:38.320 --> 04:40.920
Ever since Hathaya moved into this house,

15
04:42.560 --> 04:44.160
I've been pushed aside.

16
05:07.200 --> 05:08.240
Grandpa.

17
05:11.680 --> 05:13.480
I'm sorry

18
05:14.400 --> 05:16.240
I disappointed you.

19
05:17.920 --> 05:19.800
I tried to fix everything.

20
05:19.880 --> 05:21.440
I wanted to make you proud.

21
05:22.760 --> 05:24.160
But Raiwin is useless.

22
05:24.800 --> 05:26.360
He ruined everything.

23
05:31.040 --> 05:32.720
I'm sorry

24
05:34.200 --> 05:36.480
I caused you to end up bedridden like this.

25
05:39.480 --> 05:41.080
I feel terrible.

26
05:41.880 --> 05:44.480
I don't want you to suffer anymore.

27
05:52.320 --> 05:54.960
Grandpa never threw anything away.

28
05:57.000 --> 05:59.240
He kept everything exactly the same.

29
06:01.520 --> 06:03.120
Grandpa still loves me.

30
06:08.720 --> 06:10.560
Lying here sick like this

31
06:11.840 --> 06:13.360
must be so uncomfortable.

32
06:27.400 --> 06:28.240
Chayanee.

33
06:28.880 --> 06:30.720
Help. Help me.

34
06:32.400 --> 06:33.400
Chayanee.

35
06:33.480 --> 06:36.480
Help me…

36
06:37.080 --> 06:39.320
Grandpa, you can talk.

37
06:40.600 --> 06:42.280
Help.

38
06:53.640 --> 06:56.800
AESOP'S FABLES

39
06:56.880 --> 07:00.160
Chayanee, Grandpa can talk now. Let's get out of here.

40
07:00.240 --> 07:01.400
-Quickly. -Mom, help me.

41
07:04.080 --> 07:05.720
Let's go, sweetheart.

42
07:06.560 --> 07:07.720
Help me.

43
07:12.120 --> 07:13.120
When I was little,

44
07:15.080 --> 07:18.280
Grandpa used to read me stories that taught me to be strong.

45
07:21.200 --> 07:23.640
Now I'll read them to him.

46
07:24.320 --> 07:25.600
Help me.

47
07:27.080 --> 07:28.120
Someone's coming.

48
07:30.960 --> 07:34.120
Miss Chayanee. Madam. Don't do this!

49
07:34.200 --> 07:36.520
Shut up. I'll give you a million.

50
07:36.600 --> 07:38.680
Go stand outside. Don't let anyone come in.

51
07:40.200 --> 07:41.720
Do you want to die?

52
07:42.240 --> 07:43.960
-Go. -Yes.

53
07:45.880 --> 07:47.720
Mom, help me.

54
07:56.120 --> 07:57.120
What are you doing here?

55
07:58.040 --> 07:59.040
Well…

56
08:00.280 --> 08:02.480
I was just going to clean the prayer room.

57
08:03.720 --> 08:05.800
Then go ahead.

58
08:09.440 --> 08:12.080
What is it? Why are you stopping me?

59
08:14.840 --> 08:19.000
Miss Hathaya, please save Mr. Pichai.

60
08:19.880 --> 08:22.160
Please…

61
08:22.240 --> 08:23.600
Please help him.

62
08:23.680 --> 08:25.280
He is going to die.

63
08:27.960 --> 08:30.360
Quickly.

64
08:31.320 --> 08:33.919
Chayanee! What are you doing?

65
08:35.400 --> 08:38.039
Let go of him.

66
08:38.120 --> 08:40.240
Chamoi, drag her out.

67
08:40.320 --> 08:41.200
Let go.

68
08:41.280 --> 08:43.240
Yes. I'll drag her out just like you ordered.

69
08:44.400 --> 08:45.240
What are you doing?

70
08:45.320 --> 08:46.320
Grandpa.

71
08:46.840 --> 08:48.240
Grandpa!

72
08:48.320 --> 08:49.640
Just like you ordered.

73
08:50.160 --> 08:51.680
Chamoi!

74
08:53.760 --> 08:54.960
-Chayanee! -Let go!

75
08:55.040 --> 08:55.880
Let go of her.

76
08:56.480 --> 08:58.200
Chayanee, did you try to kill Grandpa?

77
08:58.280 --> 08:59.840
If Grandpa dies,

78
08:59.920 --> 09:01.640
everything he owns will become mine.

79
09:02.800 --> 09:04.000
You're so meddlesome.

80
09:04.080 --> 09:05.280
You can die too.

81
09:06.560 --> 09:08.680
No. Don't!

82
09:08.760 --> 09:10.440
-Chamoi! -No!

83
09:11.280 --> 09:12.680
You can't!

84
09:13.280 --> 09:14.960
-What are you doing? -Let go.

85
09:15.560 --> 09:16.880
What is going on?!

86
09:17.640 --> 09:20.720
Aunt Ann! Chayanee and Aunt Liu are trying to kill Grandpa.

87
09:21.680 --> 09:23.080
Call the police!

88
09:23.680 --> 09:24.760
Okay.

89
09:26.120 --> 09:28.160
Give me that.

90
09:30.880 --> 09:31.800
Ann!

91
09:31.880 --> 09:32.880
Here.

92
09:34.480 --> 09:35.400
Call them.

93
09:39.880 --> 09:40.880
It's hot!

94
09:40.960 --> 09:43.520
Chayanee, run!

95
09:43.600 --> 09:46.400
Hurry. Run!

96
09:48.120 --> 09:49.960
I can't take this anymore.

97
09:50.520 --> 09:52.040
Grandpa.

98
09:53.160 --> 09:56.800
Grandpa. Grandpa!

99
09:57.400 --> 09:59.480
Chayanee, what are we going to do?

100
09:59.560 --> 10:01.560
The police are going to arrest us.

101
10:01.640 --> 10:03.640
-I'm scared. -Mom, stop panicking.

102
10:03.720 --> 10:05.480
We need to get out before the police come.

103
10:07.840 --> 10:09.360
Chayanee.

104
10:16.200 --> 10:18.000
My dear.

105
10:19.480 --> 10:20.680
Sweetheart.

106
10:23.840 --> 10:24.720
Blood…

107
10:25.320 --> 10:27.840
Mom, help me.

108
10:27.920 --> 10:31.120
Sweetheart, hold on. We have to go.

109
10:34.920 --> 10:35.920
Get up.

110
10:38.040 --> 10:40.040
Chayanee.

111
10:43.000 --> 10:44.320
Come on.

112
10:46.320 --> 10:49.720
Grandpa, wake up.

113
10:52.520 --> 10:54.320
Grandpa, wake up.

114
10:58.440 --> 11:01.480
Grandpa. I'm here.

115
11:02.200 --> 11:04.680
I'm here now.

116
11:05.680 --> 11:06.720
Grandpa.

117
11:09.360 --> 11:12.400
Grandpa, you always taught me to fight.

118
11:12.960 --> 11:14.920
So you have to fight too.

119
11:16.640 --> 11:18.480
Please, Grandpa.

120
11:20.480 --> 11:22.640
I have no one left.

121
11:25.440 --> 11:27.720
I don't have anyone else.

122
11:29.880 --> 11:32.800
Please don't leave me.

123
11:33.440 --> 11:35.200
Grandpa.

124
11:38.680 --> 11:39.920
Grandpa.

125
11:41.000 --> 11:43.920
Grandpa, wake up.

126
11:49.560 --> 11:52.160
Grandpa. You're awake.

127
11:58.000 --> 11:59.720
You're awake.

128
12:00.960 --> 12:03.040
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

129
12:03.120 --> 12:05.880
From now on, I'll protect you.

130
12:06.720 --> 12:08.880
You don't have to be afraid anymore.

131
12:16.080 --> 12:17.120
Grandpa.

132
12:23.960 --> 12:24.960
My granddaughter.

133
12:26.480 --> 12:27.640
Thank you.

134
12:29.800 --> 12:32.000
My granddaughter.

135
12:34.720 --> 12:37.160
Grandpa, you can talk.

136
12:45.200 --> 12:46.400
Hathaya.

137
12:52.200 --> 12:55.600
Grandpa, you can move your hand too.

138
12:57.960 --> 12:59.280
Grandpa…

139
12:59.800 --> 13:03.040
Stay with me, Grandpa. Please stay with me.

140
13:11.000 --> 13:12.520
I already filed a police report.

141
13:13.080 --> 13:15.560
They're sending officers to find Chayanee and Liu.

142
13:18.640 --> 13:19.960
I never imagined

143
13:20.480 --> 13:23.000
they would actually try to kill Grandpa.

144
13:23.080 --> 13:25.320
Greed can blind people so badly

145
13:25.880 --> 13:27.040
that they're willing

146
13:27.120 --> 13:29.440
to kill their own family.

147
13:36.160 --> 13:37.320
Mr. Ramil.

148
13:37.840 --> 13:42.360
Miss Hathaya. Please don't send me to prison.

149
13:43.120 --> 13:44.760
I'm not pressing charges against you.

150
13:45.400 --> 13:48.080
If anything, I should thank you. You changed your mind

151
13:48.160 --> 13:50.320
and warned me in time to save Grandpa.

152
13:52.680 --> 13:53.920
I know

153
13:54.000 --> 13:56.960
I'm not a good person.

154
13:57.040 --> 14:00.160
But I'm not so evil that I could stand by

155
14:00.240 --> 14:02.560
while someone murders a person I owe so much to.

156
14:04.160 --> 14:05.960
Madam and Miss Chayanee

157
14:07.000 --> 14:08.200
have done terrible things.

158
14:09.200 --> 14:11.480
I wanted to speak up, but I couldn't.

159
14:11.560 --> 14:13.640
I owed them too much.

160
14:13.720 --> 14:15.760
But this was more than I could bear.

161
14:15.840 --> 14:19.720
They're heartless beyond belief.

162
14:20.320 --> 14:22.200
If you tell the police everything you know,

163
14:24.600 --> 14:27.160
I'll consider you a witness helping the investigation.

164
14:30.560 --> 14:31.440
Well…

165
14:32.560 --> 14:35.080
Madam and Miss Chayanee

166
14:35.760 --> 14:37.560
were the ones

167
14:38.320 --> 14:42.040
who arranged for Pong

168
14:42.120 --> 14:44.560
to sexually assault Miss Hathaya at the house

169
14:45.160 --> 14:46.840
and at the construction site.

170
14:55.040 --> 14:56.280
My mom

171
14:57.440 --> 14:59.320
was framed, wasn't she?

172
15:00.120 --> 15:00.960
Yes.

173
15:01.480 --> 15:04.480
Ms. Liu…

174
15:05.800 --> 15:08.080
was the one behind it.

175
15:08.160 --> 15:09.560
She had Pong

176
15:10.160 --> 15:13.120
take your mother to the gambling den and get her trapped in debt.

177
15:13.200 --> 15:16.560
Then she arranged for your mother

178
15:17.160 --> 15:19.360
to steal the money from the office.

179
15:20.320 --> 15:21.360
But…

180
15:22.840 --> 15:24.720
karma is real.

181
15:25.480 --> 15:26.520
What do you mean?

182
15:26.600 --> 15:28.720
Pong threatened

183
15:28.800 --> 15:31.120
to expose Madam's crimes.

184
15:31.880 --> 15:34.840
So Madam

185
15:34.920 --> 15:37.760
planned to kill him.

186
15:41.560 --> 15:44.400
We need to tell the police immediately. If we find Pong,

187
15:45.440 --> 15:46.840
it'll be easier to close the case.

188
15:47.520 --> 15:49.040
Uh…

189
15:50.080 --> 15:52.440
But Madam already killed him.

190
15:52.520 --> 15:54.040
Pong is dead.

191
15:54.120 --> 15:55.280
No.

192
15:56.400 --> 15:58.200
Hathaya and I saved him.

193
15:59.080 --> 16:00.480
But he escaped again.

194
16:04.960 --> 16:06.640
What is it, Aunt Chamoi?

195
16:08.080 --> 16:11.080
I hate to even think about it.

196
16:11.680 --> 16:12.840
Pong…

197
16:13.680 --> 16:16.960
is going to come after Madam for revenge.

198
16:20.680 --> 16:23.080
Karma is real. Like they say,

199
16:24.040 --> 16:26.280
whatever you do to others

200
16:26.360 --> 16:28.240
eventually comes back to you.

201
16:36.680 --> 16:38.560
-I'll be leaving. -Yes.

202
16:38.640 --> 16:40.240
Please excuse me.

203
16:53.360 --> 16:54.720
The doctor said…

204
16:57.880 --> 16:59.040
you lost the baby.

205
17:04.720 --> 17:07.560
I wanted to have a family.

206
17:11.160 --> 17:13.000
I thought if I had a baby,

207
17:15.319 --> 17:16.480
Grandpa would love my child

208
17:16.560 --> 17:19.079
the way he used to love me.

209
17:21.800 --> 17:23.200
Now there's nothing left.

210
17:23.960 --> 17:26.960
Everything is ruined. My whole life is ruined.

211
17:29.680 --> 17:31.640
Everything is gone, Mom.

212
17:36.360 --> 17:38.840
Forget it, sweetheart. Maybe it's for the best.

213
17:39.400 --> 17:41.120
At least we won't have to raise a child

214
17:41.200 --> 17:42.960
with their rotten blood.

215
17:47.080 --> 17:48.160
Chayanee.

216
17:48.920 --> 17:51.720
Don't think about anything right now.

217
17:52.960 --> 17:54.640
You need to recover.

218
17:55.720 --> 17:57.360
Then we'll find a way to escape.

219
18:10.080 --> 18:13.560
You look much brighter and stronger, sir.

220
18:14.400 --> 18:15.560
Keep fighting.

221
18:20.880 --> 18:21.840
Sir.

222
18:22.920 --> 18:24.280
You can move.

223
18:26.120 --> 18:29.320
It's not just my hand. I can move my legs too.

224
18:31.160 --> 18:34.040
You can talk too! Hathaya, did you hear that?

225
18:34.640 --> 18:36.120
He sure can move.

226
18:42.200 --> 18:44.760
Wait. Don't tell me you all--

227
18:45.280 --> 18:46.400
Yes, Daddy.

228
18:47.400 --> 18:48.920
Great-Grandpa has been able to talk

229
18:49.520 --> 18:51.320
and move for a while now.

230
18:51.920 --> 18:53.840
But Aunt Hathaya

231
18:53.920 --> 18:55.960
told us to keep it a secret.

232
18:58.200 --> 19:00.480
I've been dying

233
19:00.560 --> 19:02.200
to tell you.

234
19:02.280 --> 19:05.200
But Miss Hathaya strictly forbade it.

235
19:05.280 --> 19:07.040
I don't understand.

236
19:08.640 --> 19:10.760
-Why hide it from me? -I wanted Grandpa

237
19:10.840 --> 19:13.040
to get stronger first.

238
19:13.120 --> 19:15.360
I wanted you to see him healthy

239
19:15.440 --> 19:16.960
and get all excited like this.

240
19:17.720 --> 19:19.800
And I was right.

241
19:20.920 --> 19:22.320
You can't hide it at all.

242
19:24.000 --> 19:25.000
You really wanted to see it?

243
19:26.240 --> 19:29.480
Looks like I'm the third wheel now.

244
19:31.960 --> 19:33.120
Grandpa.

245
19:33.920 --> 19:36.520
Ramil has everything ready.

246
19:36.600 --> 19:38.920
You need to keep up with your physical therapy.

247
19:39.000 --> 19:41.360
Then you can attend the opening of the development.

248
19:45.720 --> 19:47.120
I'll be there.

249
19:55.320 --> 19:58.200
You can stay home and take care of Mr. Pichai.

250
19:58.280 --> 19:59.800
I can handle things here.

251
20:00.480 --> 20:02.240
Aunt Chamoi and Aunt Ann are helping.

252
20:02.320 --> 20:04.320
Papang is there too. So I feel even better.

253
20:04.400 --> 20:06.360
And I need to sort out the accounts again.

254
20:06.440 --> 20:07.600
That's good.

255
20:07.680 --> 20:09.680
You're the only one he really trusts.

256
20:10.280 --> 20:11.440
Once I finish,

257
20:11.520 --> 20:13.400
I'll help clean your office too.

258
20:13.480 --> 20:14.680
It's probably a mess.

259
20:16.120 --> 20:17.240
No, that's okay.

260
20:17.320 --> 20:20.040
I already cleaned it.

261
20:22.440 --> 20:24.080
You don't have to be polite.

262
20:24.160 --> 20:25.720
I'm not.

263
20:25.800 --> 20:28.120
I mean Max and I

264
20:28.200 --> 20:31.200
cleaned it already. Seriously. Spotless.

265
20:34.960 --> 20:36.840
Men can't be trusted with cleaning.

266
20:38.440 --> 20:40.080
You're never as thorough as women.

267
20:41.400 --> 20:44.560
It really is clean.

268
20:44.640 --> 20:47.400
I even brought in extra people to help.

269
20:48.000 --> 20:49.000
Anyway…

270
20:49.680 --> 20:51.080
I should go.

271
21:06.560 --> 21:08.360
What are you hiding in there, Ramil?

272
21:09.200 --> 21:10.040
HOME FOR SALE

273
21:10.120 --> 21:11.400
Everyone.

274
21:12.200 --> 21:13.720
Mr. Pichai is getting much stronger.

275
21:13.800 --> 21:15.920
He's going to come open the development himself.

276
21:16.000 --> 21:18.000
So let's pick up the pace. Okay?

277
21:20.120 --> 21:22.400
Boss, Miss Hathaya went to your office.

278
21:24.760 --> 21:25.720
The secret's out.

279
21:29.880 --> 21:30.720
Mom.

280
21:33.840 --> 21:36.440
-Hathaya. -What are you doing here?

281
21:37.560 --> 21:38.800
I'm sorry, sweetheart.

282
21:40.280 --> 21:42.200
Mom, wait.

283
21:42.280 --> 21:43.320
I'm not a good person.

284
21:43.400 --> 21:45.160
I don't want to cause you trouble anymore.

285
21:45.240 --> 21:48.200
And you don't want to see me. I should go.

286
21:48.280 --> 21:50.760
No. Explain this to me right now.

287
21:50.840 --> 21:52.840
What happened? Why are you here?

288
21:53.440 --> 21:54.760
Aunt Hathai has been with us.

289
21:56.000 --> 21:57.280
No point hiding it now.

290
21:58.240 --> 21:59.200
Ramil.

291
22:00.160 --> 22:01.800
You gave my mom a job here?

292
22:02.400 --> 22:03.640
After what happened that day,

293
22:05.280 --> 22:07.400
I believed your mother had been framed.

294
22:11.720 --> 22:12.920
So I found her a place to stay.

295
22:13.680 --> 22:15.920
She asked if she could help clean the office

296
22:16.000 --> 22:17.480
and the houses we're preparing.

297
22:18.680 --> 22:20.400
After you went home,

298
22:21.440 --> 22:23.760
she went to clean your office.

299
22:28.960 --> 22:30.600
I'm proud of you, sweetheart.

300
22:32.360 --> 22:34.080
She has helped me

301
22:34.800 --> 22:36.040
and the workers a lot.

302
22:36.120 --> 22:37.800
So everyone knew

303
22:39.400 --> 22:40.720
except me?

304
22:44.520 --> 22:46.240
Don't blame Ramil.

305
22:47.120 --> 22:48.640
I asked him not to tell you.

306
22:50.040 --> 22:52.120
I just wanted to help you somehow.

307
22:53.080 --> 22:55.520
I wanted to do something that might make you proud of me.

308
22:57.360 --> 23:00.440
But now you know everything.

309
23:03.040 --> 23:05.880
I should leave. I don't want to bother you anymore.

310
23:06.760 --> 23:09.240
Mom. Mom.

311
23:11.280 --> 23:12.640
I know everything now.

312
23:14.080 --> 23:16.760
Aunt Liu and Pong set you up.

313
23:19.280 --> 23:22.280
I was still wrong.

314
23:24.280 --> 23:25.600
I broke my promise.

315
23:26.840 --> 23:28.520
I couldn't control myself.

316
23:35.440 --> 23:36.400
Mom.

317
23:37.720 --> 23:39.800
Can you give yourself another chance?

318
23:42.440 --> 23:44.600
You don't have to promise me anything.

319
23:46.280 --> 23:48.000
Just give yourself another chance.

320
23:49.680 --> 23:51.480
And give me one too.

321
23:54.680 --> 23:57.440
I know you want to be a good mother to me.

322
24:00.600 --> 24:03.040
I'm still your mother, right?

323
24:04.760 --> 24:06.520
I only have one mother.

324
24:07.920 --> 24:09.320
And her name is Hathai.

325
24:19.600 --> 24:23.280
Hathaya… My girl.

326
24:48.560 --> 24:49.720
Grandpa.

327
24:50.480 --> 24:51.840
I want to ask your permission

328
24:52.400 --> 24:54.720
for Mom to come live here with me.

329
24:56.080 --> 24:59.720
I know the truth now.

330
25:00.320 --> 25:01.920
Mom was framed.

331
25:02.000 --> 25:04.680
Aunt Liu and Chayanee were behind it.

332
25:05.840 --> 25:07.720
Please forgive her, Grandpa.

333
25:09.360 --> 25:10.280
What?

334
25:11.000 --> 25:14.280
Did you lose your voice? Why must your daughter speak for you?

335
25:22.720 --> 25:26.120
Father, please give me one more chance.

336
25:27.640 --> 25:30.160
I want to come back and take care of you

337
25:30.720 --> 25:32.120
and everyone here.

338
25:32.920 --> 25:35.880
And I want to be with my daughter.

339
25:36.480 --> 25:37.840
How do I know

340
25:38.360 --> 25:40.520
you won't cause trouble again?

341
25:46.400 --> 25:48.960
You once called me a parasite.

342
25:52.120 --> 25:54.480
And you were right.

343
25:56.440 --> 25:58.040
I lived off other people.

344
25:58.880 --> 26:00.800
The moment someone stopped being useful to me,

345
26:01.760 --> 26:03.440
I abandoned them

346
26:03.520 --> 26:05.440
and found someone else.

347
26:08.920 --> 26:11.320
I never did anything for myself.

348
26:18.120 --> 26:21.320
When my own daughter

349
26:22.320 --> 26:24.160
threw me out,

350
26:26.240 --> 26:28.160
I finally had to think about everything.

351
26:28.760 --> 26:30.360
And I realized

352
26:31.040 --> 26:33.640
my life had no value at all.

353
26:34.400 --> 26:38.400
I want another chance to make things right.

354
26:42.200 --> 26:44.200
I want to start over.

355
26:45.840 --> 26:47.720
I want to take care of you.

356
26:48.400 --> 26:51.800
Take care of everyone here. And take care of my daughter.

357
26:53.080 --> 26:54.720
Please give me one more chance.

358
27:05.120 --> 27:07.280
I don't think I can give you what you're asking for.

359
27:16.680 --> 27:18.960
I don't have any authority anymore.

360
27:22.520 --> 27:24.800
I already made a new will.

361
27:29.960 --> 27:32.880
I left everything I own…

362
27:35.080 --> 27:36.640
including this house…

363
27:39.440 --> 27:40.840
to Hathaya.

364
27:49.040 --> 27:50.560
So if you want to live here,

365
27:52.120 --> 27:53.880
you'll have to ask the owner of the house.

366
27:58.360 --> 27:59.960
Grandpa.

367
28:05.440 --> 28:07.760
Thank you so much.

368
28:14.160 --> 28:15.760
Mom, come live with me.

369
28:37.840 --> 28:39.840
Sorry, the number that you've dialed cannot--

370
28:40.720 --> 28:42.000
Ramil.

371
28:43.000 --> 28:44.520
Have you been able to reach Raiwin?

372
28:45.120 --> 28:45.960
No.

373
28:46.680 --> 28:48.320
I'm not even sure he still

374
28:48.400 --> 28:49.520
uses the same number.

375
28:50.440 --> 28:51.440
What are you thinking?

376
28:52.720 --> 28:53.760
I…

377
28:54.920 --> 28:57.800
want you to ask him to turn himself in.

378
28:58.560 --> 29:00.720
The day I saw

379
29:00.800 --> 29:02.760
Raiwin about to kill Nuchwara…

380
29:03.360 --> 29:04.840
when Papang stopped him,

381
29:05.720 --> 29:07.200
I saw the look in Raiwin's eyes.

382
29:08.800 --> 29:11.960
I could tell he cares about how Papang feels.

383
29:14.880 --> 29:17.240
Even if Raiwin won't openly accept Papang as his son,

384
29:18.280 --> 29:20.240
if he spends time with him,

385
29:22.160 --> 29:24.440
I believe there's still a father's heart inside him.

386
29:26.080 --> 29:28.800
Saksit raised Raiwin

387
29:30.160 --> 29:31.720
through aggression.

388
29:33.200 --> 29:34.920
Raiwin wants a family.

389
29:35.840 --> 29:37.640
And he wants to raise his son to be good.

390
29:39.880 --> 29:40.880
You may be right.

391
29:41.920 --> 29:44.080
Raiwin isn't naturally aggressive.

392
29:44.680 --> 29:45.920
His father pressured him.

393
29:47.360 --> 29:48.760
But how can you be sure

394
29:49.760 --> 29:51.120
Raiwin loves Papang?

395
29:51.720 --> 29:53.960
If he didn't love Papang,

396
29:54.040 --> 29:56.280
he would have killed Nuchwara.

397
30:01.560 --> 30:03.280
Papang may love me as his father,

398
30:04.720 --> 30:06.280
but I still want him

399
30:07.080 --> 30:08.760
to be with his biological father.

400
30:09.640 --> 30:11.600
I understand what Papang feels.

401
30:13.200 --> 30:15.280
I was separated from my father too.

402
30:18.000 --> 30:21.000
I'll send Raiwin a message. Maybe he'll answer.

403
30:21.720 --> 30:22.560
Yes.

404
30:28.120 --> 30:31.040
Raiwin, I want to help you.

405
30:33.000 --> 30:34.440
No one can help me.

406
30:35.840 --> 30:39.440
I'll help you with your case and try to reduce the sentence.

407
30:48.480 --> 30:51.280
If you keep running, you'll be running for the rest of your life.

408
30:52.040 --> 30:53.680
How do you even know you'll get away?

409
30:58.680 --> 31:01.480
Your son is waiting for you.

410
31:13.800 --> 31:15.360
RAIWIN

411
31:17.960 --> 31:19.160
Raiwin's calling.

412
31:21.040 --> 31:21.880
Hello.

413
31:23.160 --> 31:25.920
Raiwin. You need to meet me.

414
31:27.040 --> 31:28.560
I'll take you to turn yourself in.

415
31:29.560 --> 31:30.760
Bring your father too.

416
31:35.440 --> 31:36.440
Where were you?

417
31:38.440 --> 31:39.480
The bathroom.

418
31:40.080 --> 31:42.720
Who were you talking to on the phone in the bathroom?

419
31:42.800 --> 31:45.280
I called Chayanee.

420
31:45.360 --> 31:47.720
I told her to find money for us

421
31:47.800 --> 31:49.160
so we can all escape together.

422
31:49.240 --> 31:51.840
You're planning to run away with them?

423
31:52.440 --> 31:53.560
No, Dad.

424
31:53.640 --> 31:56.120
I'm just tricking Chayanee into bringing us the money.

425
31:56.640 --> 31:58.120
Then you and I will escape.

426
32:03.040 --> 32:05.720
That's more like it.

427
32:05.800 --> 32:08.440
Now you're acting like my son.

428
32:09.440 --> 32:13.000
Tell them to bring the money as soon as possible.

429
32:13.080 --> 32:14.680
I'm sick of this place.

430
32:23.680 --> 32:24.720
Ramil.

431
32:27.360 --> 32:29.520
Are you sure Raiwin will actually show up?

432
32:29.600 --> 32:32.560
I believe he really wants to turn himself in.

433
32:33.440 --> 32:34.680
Or he wouldn't have called.

434
32:35.200 --> 32:37.800
But he asked me

435
32:37.880 --> 32:39.200
not to tell the police yet.

436
32:39.800 --> 32:41.840
He wants me to take him to see Papang first

437
32:42.440 --> 32:43.720
and apologize to Nuchwara.

438
32:44.600 --> 32:45.720
Then he'll turn himself in.

439
32:47.600 --> 32:50.360
-I'm coming with you. -No. It's dangerous.

440
32:50.440 --> 32:51.720
I'm worried about you.

441
32:52.400 --> 32:54.440
And maybe I can help somehow.

442
32:54.960 --> 32:57.360
Two people are better than one.

443
33:04.800 --> 33:06.040
Dad.

444
33:06.120 --> 33:07.720
It's almost time. We should go.

445
33:07.800 --> 33:11.040
Wait. Hold on.

446
33:11.880 --> 33:14.920
You said Chayanee and her mom

447
33:15.000 --> 33:16.640
ran from police over Pichai.

448
33:18.520 --> 33:21.040
Where are they supposed to get money for us?

449
33:21.560 --> 33:23.800
Think.

450
33:23.880 --> 33:27.320
Chayanee said she still has some savings left.

451
33:27.840 --> 33:30.280
Good. Then pack up.

452
33:30.360 --> 33:31.320
Let's go.

453
33:31.840 --> 33:33.160
I'm sick of this place.

454
33:33.240 --> 33:34.800
Come on. Pack everything.

455
33:37.200 --> 33:39.160
Who are you calling?

456
33:39.240 --> 33:40.720
Raiwin.

457
33:41.240 --> 33:42.800
Why?

458
33:42.880 --> 33:44.680
We don't have any money left to give him.

459
33:44.760 --> 33:46.920
I'll lie and tell him I do.

460
33:47.520 --> 33:49.200
Then I'll make him help us escape.

461
33:49.280 --> 33:51.360
And if they realize you're lying,

462
33:51.440 --> 33:53.240
they'll kill us.

463
33:53.840 --> 33:55.320
I'm not afraid of them.

464
33:56.280 --> 33:57.920
If they try to hurt me,

465
33:59.400 --> 34:00.880
we can fight to the death.

466
34:02.600 --> 34:04.240
I have nothing left to lose.

467
34:14.159 --> 34:15.800
Raiwin, your phone.

468
34:17.400 --> 34:18.400
Raiwin.

469
34:21.080 --> 34:22.239
Your phone is ringing.

470
34:24.520 --> 34:25.760
Who is it?

471
34:27.239 --> 34:28.480
A scammer.

472
34:28.560 --> 34:30.880
Oh?

473
34:30.960 --> 34:33.560
Those people are terrible. They only fool idiots.

474
34:33.639 --> 34:35.800
Good thing someone like me isn't stupid.

475
34:39.480 --> 34:40.760
CHAYANEE

476
34:41.360 --> 34:44.600
-Who is it now? -Same people. Scammer.

477
34:44.679 --> 34:47.679
Block them next time. Understand?

478
34:48.800 --> 34:51.239
-It's time, Dad. Let's go. -Fine.

479
34:56.880 --> 34:59.160
Raiwin isn't answering. I can't reach him at all.

480
34:59.760 --> 35:01.240
He probably turned off his phone.

481
35:01.840 --> 35:03.640
Don't depend on those people anymore.

482
35:04.240 --> 35:06.360
Then what am I supposed to do?

483
35:06.440 --> 35:08.560
Go back and ask Grandpa for help.

484
35:08.640 --> 35:09.800
Or…

485
35:09.880 --> 35:12.120
ask Hathaya.

486
35:12.200 --> 35:13.560
That woman is soft-hearted.

487
35:14.160 --> 35:15.600
Grandpa adores her.

488
35:15.680 --> 35:17.400
Whatever she asks for,

489
35:17.480 --> 35:18.520
he gives her.

490
35:18.600 --> 35:20.840
Stop saying her name.

491
35:20.920 --> 35:22.000
I hate her.

492
35:22.600 --> 35:24.320
Then what are you going to do?

493
35:33.600 --> 35:36.320
Where are Chayanee and her mother?

494
35:37.280 --> 35:38.960
We're meeting them inside, Dad.

495
35:40.760 --> 35:43.000
Fine. Then go get the money.

496
35:43.080 --> 35:44.240
I'll wait in the car.

497
35:45.320 --> 35:46.760
Dad, come inside with me.

498
35:47.920 --> 35:50.360
Why do I have to go in

499
35:50.440 --> 35:51.760
just to collect money?

500
35:51.840 --> 35:53.160
You can bring it out here.

501
35:54.680 --> 35:58.000
They know you have the connections to help us escape.

502
35:58.760 --> 36:02.640
They want to hear it directly from you. If you go in and reassure Chayanee,

503
36:02.720 --> 36:04.480
she'll hand over the money.

504
36:05.080 --> 36:06.000
I'm not going.

505
36:06.520 --> 36:09.880
Tell them if they don't trust me,

506
36:10.640 --> 36:13.400
-then they don't need my help. -Dad, please come inside.

507
36:13.480 --> 36:15.400
You go get the money.

508
36:15.480 --> 36:18.120
Hurry up. Before the police come and arrest us.

509
36:18.200 --> 36:20.520
Go.

510
36:29.200 --> 36:31.640
Who are you calling now?

511
36:32.360 --> 36:34.160
Raiwin won't answer me.

512
36:34.240 --> 36:36.000
So I'll call his father.

513
36:36.600 --> 36:38.440
I'll trick him into helping us escape.

514
36:41.120 --> 36:42.880
Chayanee, why are you calling me?

515
36:43.560 --> 36:45.200
Your son won't answer me.

516
36:45.280 --> 36:46.920
So I had to call you.

517
36:47.600 --> 36:48.720
Wait.

518
36:49.920 --> 36:52.680
Raiwin arranged to meet you for the money.

519
36:52.760 --> 36:54.880
He just went inside to see you.

520
36:54.960 --> 36:57.120
How could Raiwin be coming to see me?

521
36:57.200 --> 36:59.840
He won't answer my calls. He even blocked my number.

522
37:00.440 --> 37:01.440
Then who is he meeting?

523
37:02.640 --> 37:04.160
I called because I want you

524
37:04.240 --> 37:05.640
to come get the money

525
37:05.720 --> 37:07.640
and help Mom and me escape.

526
37:09.960 --> 37:11.280
I'll call you back.

527
37:11.360 --> 37:14.520
Where are you? Hello?

528
37:16.400 --> 37:17.440
What did they say?

529
37:18.040 --> 37:19.520
Raiwin claimed he arranged to meet me.

530
37:20.440 --> 37:22.240
But I have no idea who he's actually meeting.

531
37:36.640 --> 37:39.080
I'm going to meet Raiwin. Wait here.

532
37:40.120 --> 37:42.760
Be careful. I'm worried about you.

533
37:42.840 --> 37:44.600
I'll take good care of myself.

534
37:47.000 --> 37:49.120
And I'll come back smiling for you. Okay?

535
37:51.960 --> 37:52.800
Wait here.

536
38:01.360 --> 38:02.360
Where's your father?

537
38:03.160 --> 38:04.240
He won't come inside.

538
38:05.680 --> 38:07.800
Do you think he knows you're turning yourself in?

539
38:08.400 --> 38:09.480
I don't think so.

540
38:11.120 --> 38:14.000
What do we do, Ramil? How do we get him to turn himself in too?

541
38:14.760 --> 38:15.920
If he won't come to us,

542
38:16.760 --> 38:17.720
we go to him.

543
38:18.600 --> 38:20.520
We have to persuade him to do so.

544
38:22.160 --> 38:23.560
He won't surrender.

545
38:24.440 --> 38:25.760
He refuses to die in prison.

546
38:26.720 --> 38:27.920
We still have to try.

547
38:29.040 --> 38:30.000
I'll come with you.

548
38:32.600 --> 38:33.600
Let's go.

549
38:46.440 --> 38:47.520
Dad's gone.

550
38:48.560 --> 38:49.600
Do you think he ran?

551
38:57.000 --> 38:58.000
Ramil, watch out!

552
38:59.240 --> 39:00.760
Dad!

553
39:00.840 --> 39:03.240
Don't move.

554
39:03.320 --> 39:06.480
All of you ruined my life. You're all going to die.

555
39:06.560 --> 39:08.280
You ruined your own life.

556
39:09.080 --> 39:12.120
No one forced you to do evil. No one forced you to steal.

557
39:12.880 --> 39:15.320
You messed up. Now you have to face the consequences.

558
39:15.400 --> 39:16.240
No.

559
39:17.040 --> 39:18.800
Ramil, don't lecture me.

560
39:22.880 --> 39:23.720
Dad.

561
39:25.520 --> 39:26.960
Enough.

562
39:27.560 --> 39:29.320
Raiwin, you too.

563
39:29.920 --> 39:31.960
You said you were going to help me.

564
39:32.560 --> 39:35.760
But you sided with them.

565
39:36.360 --> 39:37.720
You're saving yourself.

566
39:39.160 --> 39:40.320
No, Dad.

567
39:42.160 --> 39:43.840
I never planned to betray you.

568
39:46.440 --> 39:48.280
I'm trying to help you.

569
39:48.360 --> 39:50.320
Don't pretend this is about helping me.

570
39:50.880 --> 39:52.640
You're saving yourself.

571
39:54.600 --> 39:55.640
I've tried

572
39:57.520 --> 39:58.920
to help you with everything.

573
40:00.840 --> 40:01.880
All these years,

574
40:02.600 --> 40:05.640
whatever you ordered me to do, I did.

575
40:08.760 --> 40:11.840
You even forced me to kill Uncle Anon.

576
40:12.920 --> 40:14.000
Shut up.

577
40:17.920 --> 40:18.960
Move.

578
40:20.000 --> 40:21.200
Enough, Dad.

579
40:22.120 --> 40:24.800
I'm grown now. I have a son.

580
40:26.360 --> 40:28.440
Let me make my own decisions.

581
40:29.960 --> 40:33.400
It's humiliating. I became Subdistrict Chief,

582
40:34.400 --> 40:35.960
but I was still a parasite

583
40:36.920 --> 40:39.760
living off your influence and obeying your every order.

584
40:41.720 --> 40:44.520
Even an ordinary villager

585
40:44.600 --> 40:47.800
has more dignity than I do. More dignity than you.

586
40:47.880 --> 40:49.800
Stop talking. Shut up.

587
40:50.880 --> 40:52.000
Move.

588
40:54.600 --> 40:56.600
I'm going to kill every one of these parasites.

589
40:58.440 --> 40:59.280
Move.

590
41:03.680 --> 41:05.200
Let me ask you one thing.

591
41:08.000 --> 41:11.000
I'm Raiwin. Your son.

592
41:14.800 --> 41:16.400
Did you ever love me?

593
41:18.360 --> 41:21.840
You betrayed me.

594
41:22.600 --> 41:24.520
-Move. -Well?

595
41:26.080 --> 41:28.680
I said move.

596
41:28.760 --> 41:31.480
And don't come any closer.

597
41:35.080 --> 41:38.160
I said move. I'm going to kill all of them.

598
41:39.000 --> 41:40.080
Did you ever love me?

599
41:41.360 --> 41:42.480
Ever?

600
41:42.560 --> 41:45.720
No. No.

601
41:45.800 --> 41:48.000
Don't come closer. Stay away from me.

602
41:49.160 --> 41:50.080
Move.

603
41:50.680 --> 41:51.760
Step closer and I'll shoot.

604
41:53.880 --> 41:55.400
Don't come closer. Don't.

605
41:56.040 --> 41:59.640
-I'm your son. Do you love me? -No…

606
42:01.480 --> 42:03.400
Stay away from me. I said move.

607
42:04.400 --> 42:05.320
Enough, Dad.

608
42:05.400 --> 42:07.920
-Please. Did you ever love me? -Stay back!

609
42:14.360 --> 42:15.200
-Enough, Dad. -Stop.

610
42:28.800 --> 42:30.240
Give me the gun.

611
42:30.320 --> 42:31.800
Stop.

612
42:31.880 --> 42:34.040
Let go. I said give me the gun.

613
42:34.120 --> 42:35.400
Give it to me.

614
42:41.000 --> 42:42.200
Dad, enough.

615
42:42.800 --> 42:45.280
Please, Dad.

616
42:57.800 --> 42:58.960
Hey.

617
42:59.520 --> 43:00.520
Raiwin, how bad is it?

618
43:01.720 --> 43:02.800
Ramil.

619
43:02.880 --> 43:04.880
We need to get him to the hospital.

620
43:05.480 --> 43:06.680
Come on.

621
43:06.760 --> 43:09.040
-Can you stand? -Easy.

622
43:28.720 --> 43:30.000
I don't even know

623
43:31.200 --> 43:32.640
whether surviving

624
43:33.960 --> 43:36.040
was good luck or bad luck.

625
43:39.280 --> 43:41.480
It hurts knowing…

626
43:42.760 --> 43:44.360
Dad never loved me.

627
43:46.280 --> 43:49.520
He was willing to kill his own son.

628
43:51.680 --> 43:52.640
Come on.

629
43:54.320 --> 43:55.480
Don't dwell on it.

630
43:56.040 --> 43:58.720
You'll only hurt yourself more.

631
44:01.040 --> 44:03.640
I'm sorry this happened to you.

632
44:05.480 --> 44:08.480
None of us chooses to be born into situations like this.

633
44:09.560 --> 44:12.840
You, Ramil,

634
44:14.560 --> 44:15.680
or me…

635
44:18.240 --> 44:20.160
all of us have had terrible things

636
44:20.240 --> 44:22.320
happen in our families.

637
44:23.440 --> 44:25.760
No family is perfect.

638
44:27.040 --> 44:29.040
No parent is perfect.

639
44:30.600 --> 44:32.040
And we are

640
44:32.720 --> 44:34.520
not perfect either.

641
44:37.360 --> 44:39.640
From a Buddhist perspective,

642
44:41.040 --> 44:43.200
everything happens according to karma.

643
44:43.960 --> 44:46.720
We're in each other's lives because of karma.

644
44:47.600 --> 44:48.960
But what matters is that

645
44:49.480 --> 44:52.000
we don't tie our entire lives to someone else,

646
44:53.600 --> 44:55.200
not even the people who gave us life.

647
44:57.160 --> 44:59.080
Good or bad, we choose who we are.

648
45:00.680 --> 45:02.520
I think you're fortunate.

649
45:04.360 --> 45:05.920
You're still alive.

650
45:07.560 --> 45:09.000
You can still set things right

651
45:10.240 --> 45:11.760
and be with the people you love.

652
45:17.280 --> 45:18.320
I know

653
45:20.280 --> 45:21.560
you care about Papang.

654
45:23.400 --> 45:25.000
And Papang is probably

655
45:26.440 --> 45:27.640
waiting for you to hold him.

656
45:30.120 --> 45:31.800
Hathaya is right.

657
45:33.760 --> 45:35.280
I have a good younger brother.

658
45:40.080 --> 45:43.240
You've always helped me and forgiven me.

659
45:45.800 --> 45:47.400
I'm sorry, Ramil.

660
45:48.840 --> 45:50.840
I tried to hurt you in so many ways.

661
45:51.520 --> 45:53.880
I'm glad

662
45:55.840 --> 45:57.440
I finally have my big brother back.

663
46:09.280 --> 46:12.480
I think you can still be a good father to Papang.

664
46:13.600 --> 46:15.560
I'm too ashamed to face him.

665
46:18.800 --> 46:20.400
I'm a terrible father.

666
46:24.040 --> 46:27.360
I almost killed his mother.

667
46:31.240 --> 46:33.680
I'll explain things to Papang.

668
46:35.880 --> 46:38.320
I believe he can forgive you.

669
46:42.360 --> 46:44.560
Great-Grandpa, walk toward me.

670
46:47.400 --> 46:49.440
One more step.

671
46:50.840 --> 46:52.400
Alright.

672
46:52.480 --> 46:54.640
Great-Grandpa, you're the literal GOAT!

673
46:56.240 --> 46:58.800
What did you say? A goat?

674
46:59.560 --> 47:01.760
It means you're the greatest of all time!

675
47:04.880 --> 47:08.560
My Papang is the GOAT too.

676
47:08.640 --> 47:10.840
And the cutest too.

677
47:24.200 --> 47:25.200
Alright.

678
47:25.800 --> 47:27.040
Okay.

679
47:27.880 --> 47:29.040
-Let's go back. -Yes.

680
47:29.120 --> 47:30.120
Go, Mom.

681
47:42.360 --> 47:43.280
Papang.

682
47:45.480 --> 47:47.360
Daddy Raiwin isn't feeling well.

683
47:48.920 --> 47:51.000
Will you come visit him with us?

684
47:51.720 --> 47:53.960
But I'm scared.

685
47:57.480 --> 47:59.040
Are you very scared?

686
47:59.640 --> 48:02.560
Very, very scared.

687
48:03.160 --> 48:06.040
Scared to the moon and back?

688
48:06.640 --> 48:09.320
The most scared ever.

689
48:09.920 --> 48:11.640
I'll tell you a secret.

690
48:11.720 --> 48:14.080
That day, a giant monster

691
48:14.160 --> 48:16.200
got inside Daddy Raiwin.

692
48:16.280 --> 48:19.040
That's why Daddy Raiwin turned into a scary giant.

693
48:19.560 --> 48:22.760
But now he has defeated that giant.

694
48:23.600 --> 48:24.520
That's right.

695
48:24.600 --> 48:27.080
Daddy Raiwin is himself again now.

696
48:27.680 --> 48:29.920
And he's hurt pretty badly.

697
48:30.520 --> 48:32.640
He needs special medicine to get better.

698
48:33.240 --> 48:36.480
Then you and Aunt Hathaya should buy some medicine

699
48:36.560 --> 48:40.000
and take it to Daddy Raiwin.

700
48:40.640 --> 48:41.840
The problem is

701
48:41.920 --> 48:44.920
you can't buy this medicine anywhere in the world.

702
48:45.000 --> 48:46.280
Because it's magic medicine.

703
48:46.880 --> 48:48.520
But do you know where it is?

704
48:50.280 --> 48:51.440
Right here.

705
48:53.200 --> 48:55.440
If you want Daddy Raiwin to get better,

706
48:55.520 --> 48:57.560
all you have to do is put

707
48:57.640 --> 48:58.920
your chest against his.

708
48:59.000 --> 49:00.880
Then he'll start getting better.

709
49:03.160 --> 49:06.400
Please. Come help us heal your dad.

710
49:08.040 --> 49:09.040
Please?

711
49:09.840 --> 49:12.080
I'll take the magic medicine

712
49:12.160 --> 49:13.920
to help Daddy Raiwin.

713
49:14.520 --> 49:16.840
That's my boy. You're amazing.

714
49:17.520 --> 49:18.480
So brave.

715
49:33.520 --> 49:34.960
I never meant to hurt you.

716
49:35.040 --> 49:37.040
You were pointing a gun at me.

717
49:37.120 --> 49:39.640
A father willing to kill his own son?

718
49:39.720 --> 49:42.640
And what if it were me? What would you do then?

719
49:42.720 --> 49:44.640
Just don't betray me, Mom.

720
49:45.400 --> 49:47.400
‎NEXT EPISODE

721
51:47.240 --> 51:49.240
Subtitle translation by: Thanit Puncharoen
